{
  "annotations": { "list": [ { "builtIn": 1, "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" }, "enable": true, "hide": true, "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)", "name": "Annotations & Alerts", "type": "dashboard" } ] },
  "description": "Security & compliance validation for Faro — PII scrubber hits, CORS violations, CSP violations, mixed-content warnings, sampling rate, token leak detection, GDPR data-subject footprint, rate-limit effectiveness.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 2,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    { "title": "⬆ L0 Executive", "url": "/d/faro-l0-executive", "type": "link", "icon": "dashboard", "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true },
    { "title": "User & Auth", "url": "/d/faro-user-auth", "type": "link", "icon": "dashboard", "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true }
  ],
  "panels": [
    { "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }, "id": 100, "title": "🔒 Privacy Controls", "type": "row" },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "PII scrubber pattern matches (email, ssn, credit card, phone, token).",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "#73BF69", "value": null } ] }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "sum(increase(faro_pii_scrubbed_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__range]))", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "PII Scrubbed (range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "Configured sampling rate — % of events kept. Lower = more privacy.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "decimals": 2, "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "#73BF69", "value": null } ] }, "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "avg(faro_sampling_rate{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"})", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Sampling Rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "Rate limited / throttled by SDK.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "#73BF69", "value": null } ] }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "sum(increase(faro_events_rate_limited_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__range]))", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Rate-Limit Events",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "Unique user IDs tracked — GDPR data-subject footprint.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "mappings": [], "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "#73BF69", "value": null } ] }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "count(count by (user_id) (faro_page_views_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\",user_id!=\"\"}))", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "Unique User IDs Tracked",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    { "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 6 }, "id": 101, "title": "🛡️ CSP / CORS / Mixed Content", "type": "row" },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "Content Security Policy violations reported by browsers.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 80, "lineWidth": 1, "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "sum by (violated_directive) (rate(faro_csp_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{violated_directive}}", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "CSP Violations",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" },
      "description": "CORS failures reaching Faro.",
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 80, "lineWidth": 1 }, "unit": "short" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": { "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "sum(rate(faro_cors_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "CORS", "refId": "A" },
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource" }, "expr": "sum(rate(faro_mixed_content_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "Mixed-Content", "refId": "B" }
      ],
      "title": "CORS / Mixed-Content Issues",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    { "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 }, "id": 102, "title": "🕵️ Token & Secret Leak Detection", "type": "row" },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "$datasource_loki" },
      "description": "Detect URLs or log values containing tokens/secrets that Faro captured (post-scrub verification). Anything here should be investigated.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": { "dedupStrategy": "none", "enableLogDetails": true, "showCommonLabels": false, "showTime": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "wrapLogMessage": true },
      "targets": [ { "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "$datasource_loki" }, "expr": "{cluster=~\"$cluster\",stack=~\"$stack\",namespace=~\"$namespace\",app=\"faro\"} |~ \"(?i)(api[_-]?key|secret|bearer|password|token)=[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-]{8,}\" | line_format \"⚠ POTENTIAL LEAK: {{.kind}}/{{.page_url}} → {{__line__}}\"", "refId": "A" } ],
      "title": "⚠ Potential Secret Leaks (investigate any match)",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    { "collapsed": false, "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 }, "id": 103, "title": "📜 Governance & Compliance Posture", "type": "row" },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
      "description": "Runtime compliance posture — refresh this table after each policy review.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": { "code": { "language": "markdown", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false }, "content": "## Faro Governance Checklist\n\n| # | Control | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---------|--------|----------|\n| 1 | **PII scrubber** enabled on URL query, request body, user object | ✅ / ❌ | `faro_pii_scrubbed_total` > 0 |\n| 2 | **Sampling rate** documented & within policy | ✅ / ❌ | `faro_sampling_rate` panel above |\n| 3 | **CSP** includes Faro collector endpoint, nothing broader | ✅ / ❌ | CSP Violations panel = 0 for self-origin |\n| 4 | **CORS** limited to known Grafana origins | ✅ / ❌ | CORS Violations panel |\n| 5 | **HTTPS** only — no mixed content | ✅ / ❌ | Mixed-Content panel = 0 |\n| 6 | **Token leak scan** — regex verified clean | ✅ / ❌ | Potential Leaks panel (must be empty) |\n| 7 | **Data retention** — Loki/Mimir/Tempo retention <= policy | ✅ / ❌ | Limits config |\n| 8 | **GDPR Subject Delete** — process documented | ✅ / ❌ | Runbook link |\n| 9 | **Consent banner** fires before Faro init | ✅ / ❌ | Manual audit |\n| 10 | **Tenant isolation** — Faro writes to isolated tenant IDs | ✅ / ❌ | Datasource Impact dashboard |\n| 11 | **No third-party exfiltration** — Faro beacon only goes to internal collector | ✅ / ❌ | Browser network inspector audit |\n| 12 | **Audit log** for config changes to Faro enablement | ✅ / ❌ | Grafana config changelog |\n\n> Update this panel after each quarterly review. Evidence link each row to the runbook/ticket that proves it.", "mode": "markdown" },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.4",
      "title": "Governance Checklist",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
